      "title": "🚀 [REMOTE] 7 QA & AI ROLES (VIETNAMESE ONLY)",
      "description": "💰 Compensation: Negotiable for all roles\n📍 Remote | Full-time Mon to Fri, 8-5 (VNT)\n📍 English Proficient (B2-C1)\n\nA global technology company running multi-region platforms is moving its entire operation to an AI-agent model. We’re looking for 7 key people:\n\n1. QA Director – 15+ years of experience, has led large QA organizations (Manual + Automation) and driven AI transformation in QA\n\n2. Principal QA Engineer – Automation – 10+ years, Playwright/TypeScript, CI/CD (Jenkins), K6, has built AI agents for testing\n\n3. Principal QA Specialist – Manual – 10+ years, risk-based test design, API/SQL, load & security testing, AI-powered QA workflows\n\n4. AI Automation Lead – QA – 4–6 years, has deployed real autonomous AI systems in production, embeds in the QA team, measurable ROI\n\n5. AI Automation Lead – L&D – 4–6 years, has deployed real autonomous AI workflows, embeds in Learning & Development (training, onboarding, content creation), drives adoption\n\n6. AI Automation Lead – C&B – 4–6 years, has deployed real autonomous AI agents, embeds in Compensation & Benefits (payroll, total rewards), strong data governance and risk judgment\n\n7. Principal AI Specialist – 8+ years, Python/JS, LLM/MCP/RAG/agents, has managed a technical team\n \n 📩 Interested? Send me a DM or reach out directly!\n 📱 Zalo: 076 471 1470",
